Every entry must carry a DOI or arXiv ID and an opened-by note.
Do not add an entry you have not opened yourself.

Entry format: the at-sign, then article or inproceedings, then braces
containing: key, author, title, journal, year, doi, and
note = {opened-by: <name>, <date>}

BibTeX has no comment character, so this header is ignored only because it
contains no at-sign. Do not put an example entry here.
